                "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Outfit,sans-serif;padding-right:40px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EDE9FE;color:#7C3AED;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">❓ FAQ</div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:38px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;\">Common<br><span style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563EB,#7C3AED);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;\">Questions</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"color:#6B7280;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;\">Quick answers to the most common questions from prospective students.</p>\n</div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "con_faq_rcol",
          "elType": "column",
          "settings": {
            "width": {
              "unit": "%",
              "size": 62
            },
            "column_padding": {
              "unit": "px",
              "top": "0",
              "right": "15",
              "bottom": "0",
              "left": "15",
              "isLinked": false
            }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "con_faq_acc",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "accordion",
              "settings": {
                "tabs": [
                  {
                    "tab_title": "How do I enroll in a DMIT course?",
                    "tab_content": "You can enroll by filling out the contact form on this page, calling us directly, or visiting our Colombo campus. Our admissions team will guide you through the registration process."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "Do you offer a free trial or demo class?",
                    "tab_content": "Yes! We offer a free introductory session for all our main courses. You can attend one class online or in-person before making your enrollment decision. Contact us to book your free demo session."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "What payment methods do you accept?",
                    "tab_content": "We accept cash, bank transfer, credit/debit cards, and online payment. We also offer flexible monthly payment plans for all courses."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "Can I switch courses after enrolling?",
                    "tab_content": "Yes, within the first two weeks of enrollment, you can switch to a different course at no extra cost (subject to availability)."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "Are certificates recognized internationally?",
                    "tab_content": "Our certificates are industry-recognized and valued by employers across Sri Lanka and internationally. Many of our graduates work at Google, Meta, and leading agencies across Asia."
                  }
                ],
                "selected_icon": {
                  "value": "fas fa-plus",
                  "library": "fa-solid"
                },
                "selected_active_icon": {
                  "value": "fas fa-times",
                  "library": "fa-solid"
                },
                "title_html_tag": "div",
                "border_width": {
